        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Demonstrated ability to perform histochemical stains and all other special procedures as required by the Chief of Pathology (Employer), including knowledge of the biochemical nature of reaction. Must be certified as a Histologic Technician or Histologic Technologist by the American Society of Clinical Pathologists or an equivalent society, as approved by the Chief of Pathology. Experience requirement normally thirty (30) months or more as a Histologic Technician.",
