        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. \"Hands on\" training will be provided by a qualified Echocardiographic Technologist with consultation by the Cardiologist and Laboratory Manager. The training would be conducted over six (6) months at twenty (20) hours per week. The Trainee will be expected to continue with home study on his/her own time. Home study would include a course in cross-sectional anatomy and other topics identified by the trainer and Cardiologist.",
